{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ef65cfae1e32ef4cf413b6511d1287ba34595c82153335bc114b7a0c207e2982", "ja": "（ん？　床に紙くずが……。\n何か書いてあるみたいだけど、どれどれ）", "zh": "（嗯？地上有纸屑……\n上面好像有写字，我看看。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3b94e163f66cf52bc987a5995e91b6621b3171d1a7a3c013ace21e4df63b05b2", "ja": "『亜美ヒメゎこの悪のティオーがァズヵった！　\n返してほしくば～』って、なんだこれ？", "zh": "『亚美皇后被邪恶的本帝王掳走了！\n想救回她的话～』呃，这是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "718a0a54bb3d1734261faa2ce59fa08fd42d809eef7f72b8250569fb5e081965", "ja": "うあうあ、兄ちゃんっ！　フライングだよっ！\nせっかく亜美がさらわれようとしてたのに～！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊，大哥哥！你太早来了！\n亚美正准备要被掳走的说～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "0fb58afe8c840fe215900716b251437d2a019f169a319223402cefbdd148b6a7", "ja": "姫がさらわれないと冒険が始まらないっしょ！　\nこれだから最近の若いモンは……。", "zh": "公主要是没有被掳走，冒险就无法展开！\n就是这样才说最近的年轻人啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "ec8bef18cad60d1e0b80fe7bff1dbe1143d47c38e2f61b42e3b5e76cc563bd19", "ja": "こうなったら亜美が勇者になって、\nさらわれた兄ちゃんを助けるしかない！", "zh": "既然如此，就只能让亚美化身成勇者，\n去拯救被掳走的大哥哥了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "2678aa3ea4cc3781169a993277800b2ae6b7118176f22260a2e287365eb0879a", "ja": "まっててね、兄ちゃん姫。いま勇者ひなひな亜美が、\nわくわく非道なテイオーから救ってみせるから！", "zh": "你等着喔，大哥哥公主，现在就让勇者后后亚美\n从无法无天的帝王手中拯救你吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1a6b900360fb1d82cc3b8c0a8ff23bba0b81ff8c9aeb6cc2c8ca80519a90fda9", "ja": "楽しそうだな……。でも俺にさらわれる予定はないぞ？\nというか、今度は何をやらかすつもりなんだ？", "zh": "你好像很开心……但我没打算要被人掳走喔。\n是说，你这次是要胡搞什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "3719e516a6058c605cff946452624b12b563c5908a62c870735137e316b42863", "ja": "やらかすだなんて……。ひどいよん。\n亜美のこと、そんな風に見てたんだね？", "zh": "说什么胡搞……太过分了。\n原来你是这样看待亚美的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "ac9386eeb86f0612222f9f8387127157ccc6bb76231eb9d0e768256815635948", "ja": "せっかく亜美がひな壇のひなひなみたいに\nお姫様っぽくなろうってがんばっているのに……。", "zh": "难得亚美想要努力变得像是娃娃坛上的后后\n一样有公主的感觉耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1009_p", "source_sha256": "052216285717bb451cb7811e2e2a1689420ca387e1b341f679d6cd22fd598ce7", "ja": "ああ、その衣装がおひな様みたいだから……。\nって、それとさらわれることに何の関係があるんだ？", "zh": "原来如此，是因为那套服装很像皇后娃娃啊……\n不对，这跟被人掳走有什么关系？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "24d04c612fea0ddee331f3ed595b7ba9a4305350218c3b0f1415c86bdfc74c33", "ja": "関係大アリだよっ！　亜美がやってるゲームだと\nお姫様って、いっつもさらわれてるもん！", "zh": "关系可大了！亚美在玩的游戏里，\n公主每次都会被人掳走啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "aedd6789f1fa71664f5a17da908893fbeaa7a0c61caaec5502d1d70a35fcc75e", "ja": "うう、このままだとひなひなになれないよ。\nどうしよ、兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "呜呜，这样下去亚美就变不成后后了。\n怎么办，大哥哥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "423a7b8570fd8cca31125bb1124d168e1de72a8a5e6f313ef10cff9bf0be71f0", "ja": "どうしよ、兄ちゃん……。", "zh": "怎么办，大哥哥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b0dd4dd220de686c5e17c13e07cced4b2aa335b376484cae072c70a5fe2e407a", "ja": "わかったよ、さらわれるよ……。\nで、具体的には何をすればいいんだ？", "zh": "好啦，让你被掳走就是了……\n那具体来说我要做什么才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "09e7284f8aafc2c3ee13b4f0b43ab6f00898102e1a31f3c241335de3c7412cfb", "ja": "わーい！　兄ちゃんありがとー☆　ちょろいよね！", "zh": "耶──！大哥哥谢谢你──☆你真好哄呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1016_p", "source_sha256": "820048735a65e704efa6fe40c276bec9296ca6fd976cd4406292e906c5d00f75", "ja": "何か言ったか？", "zh": "你刚刚说了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "dfbf95fc58853e0e722a7ad5dd039f03048aa3883e6b76f987cd51c47a89daef", "ja": "言ってな～い♪　んじゃ、そこにある服に着替えて。\nこれから兄ちゃんは勇者だいだいとなるのだ～！", "zh": "没有喔～♪快换上放在那里的衣服吧。\n接下来大哥哥要化身成勇者皇皇了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1018_p", "source_sha256": "120431bf39e21bc9bebf807a91d7d173f2294eef042854ac231eefc1644a639d", "ja": "そこって……。これ、お内裏様の着物か！\nこんなものどこからもってきたんだ！？", "zh": "放在那里的……这不是天皇娃娃的和服吗！\n你去哪里找来这种衣服的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "55ac297a15401b3554ded3fd17497cffa6380dafac7db275456ff4ab3d11f819", "ja": "兄ちゃんに着せたいって、みさきちに言ったら\nノリノリで作ってくれたよ？", "zh": "亚美跟美咲咲说想让大哥哥穿，\n她就很起劲地做出来了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3dd6da2b46f6a92e7cdbac555e44408a06cbb10d9f45ba03d1dd2869b105eccb", "ja": "あ、青羽さん……、余計な仕事をすみません……。\nでも、着付けの仕方なんて知らないぞ。", "zh": "青、青羽小姐……对不起给你增加多余的工作……\n但是，我不知道要怎么穿喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "921efd2339bd23602df6a1aa388b8a2d7275a9413686692d7666c27c83e575e1", "ja": "んっふっふ～、そこは亜美にオマカセだよ！\nはいはーい、目つぶってればスグ終わるからね～。", "zh": "嗯哼哼～这就交给亚美吧！\n来来来──把眼睛闭上，一下就结束啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1022_p", "source_sha256": "746d8e0859a981ed3b5377bc4b48aa2d1f13be4a7b66066eb6bca5177ad3fcb1", "ja": "ま、待て。わかった。自分で何とかするから、\n亜美は少し待ってて……わっ、うわーっ！", "zh": "等、等一下，我知道了，我会自己想办法穿上，\n亚美稍微等我一下……哇、呜哇──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "f9437b60543f4fe7f526cd4851a23707c6f4bb6ec57bf6113278aeca73d0d00a", "ja": "おおっ、ぴったし♪　超似合ってるよ、兄ちゃん！\nマロにも衣装でおじゃりまする～☆", "zh": "哦哦，很合身♪超适合你的喔，大哥哥！\n果然是贵族也要金装呀～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1024_p", "source_sha256": "06970dd73f4feee2278076bc52f329bf4fb9f5c13aff56bb4d40fffe43be362d", "ja": "まさか、スタイリストさんとメイクさんまで\n呼んでいたとは……。", "zh": "想不到你居然早就找来了\n造型师跟化妆师……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1025_011ami", "source_sha256": "551b7c0f08b619bbca45d07595757f552f4967f3bfe0931c8670789b1bc24547", "ja": "そんなとこ感心しなくていいってば～。それより、\nだいだいなんだからホラ、ひなひなの隣に来て来て！", "zh": "你不用因为这种事佩服亚美啦～更重要的是，\n你是皇皇耶，快点到后后身边来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "4e9482f56e699ba61b8c04845dbcf8c31e19148baa0657088a04d19ed40f5e8f", "ja": "一緒に写真、撮りまくってもらおーね！\nはーい、次はカメラマンの姉ちゃん、かもーん！", "zh": "快点让人帮亚美我们一起疯狂拍照吧！\n来──下一位是摄影师大姊姊，Come on！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1027_p", "source_sha256": "4615c58779ee5d8503fde8e94a0b156e0c4711b42e07c6558023e9436878cfd0", "ja": "うわっ、早坂さんまで呼んでたのか？\nん？　青羽さんに……音無さんまで、なぜここに！？", "zh": "呜哇，你连早坂小姐都找来了吗？\n嗯？是青羽小姐……怎么连音无小姐都来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1028_p", "source_sha256": "97ea2abdcc8523421a1dde814f4f825c58f06417557c4182435271d6d8d5ad6d", "ja": "（その後、いろんな人に、あんな写真やこんな写真を\nひたすら撮られまくった……）", "zh": "（之后一大堆人叫我们摆出各种姿势，\n不停地拍了各种照片……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0104_1029_p", "source_sha256": "15190c12270dcbcbd918b4bc463ced297f5599b50df4cc45aff5ef28d56f68d9", "ja": "（お姫様のワガママに付き合うのは疲れたけど、\nまあ、亜美が楽しそうだったから、良しとするか）", "zh": "（配合公主的任性陪她玩耍是很累，\n但亚美好像很开心，也算是好事一件吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
